	(footprint "SW_Toggle_DPDT_SubMini_PCMount"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "bc3b6b05-0c42-4c76-9217-cb1843e79d5c")
		(at 9.9 33)
		(descr "Sub-miniature DPDT toggle, PCB-mount, straight PC thru-hole terminals, 1/4-40 UNS-2A threaded bushing. C&K 7000 series, part 7201SYCQE: 7201 DPDT ON-NONE-ON, S actuator (.410 in, standard with C termination), Y bushing (.350 in threaded, keyway), C termination (PC thru-hole), Q contact material, E epoxy seal. PC MOUNTING GRID VERIFIED against the C&K 7000 series datasheet page A-10 (termination C, SPDT thru 4PDT): .185 in (4.70 mm) between terminals along a column, .190 in (4.83 mm) between the two rows, .073 in (1.85 mm) dia ROUND holes. Terminal section .050 x .030 in (1.27 x 0.76 mm). Moulded base 11.43 x 12.70 mm (.450 x .500 in) - that is the BASE outline, not the terminal span. Body 8.89 mm (.350 in) deep behind the mounting face, which is what lets it reach the PCB through the panel gap. Panel hole .250 in (6.35 mm) dia per datasheet page A-9. MUST be ordered with Q (silver) contact material: 5 A @ 120 VAC / 28 VDC. The B (gold) option is rated 0.4 VA max and will be destroyed by rail current.")
		(tags "switch toggle DPDT sub-miniature THT panel bushing 1/4-40 7201 PCB-mount")
